Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.4.39-rt53 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.4.39 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  Head SHA1: cf3258b32dd7e284a4429d044a75bb44ca1914a4


Or to build 3.4.39-rt53 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.4.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.4.39.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.4/patch-3.4.39-rt53.patch.xz



Enjoy,

-- Steve
